{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global Conflict Blue: Horizon is a real-time modern warfare simulator that puts you in command at both the tactical and operational levels. Built on a powerful simulation engine and enhanced with a streamlined, modern interface, Horizon delivers immersive gameplay across air, naval, and other domains of conflict.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World Map</strong> - Engage in scenarios anywhere on the globe, from regional flashpoints to global conflicts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Equipment Database</strong> \u2013 Access a library of military platforms spanning the 1980s to near-future technologies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scenario Editor</strong> \u2013 Create, customize, and share your own scenarios with the built-in editor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modding Support</strong> \u2013 Tailor the database, unit tactics, and gameplay settings to match your vision of modern warfare.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3D Overlay</strong> \u2013 Open a 3D window to visualize the action without leaving the strategic view.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4069800?t=1772107216","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4069800?t=1772107216","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069800/49cc9068bcd3b73505a137a52c3730ba7b22d120/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772107216","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069800/49cc9068bcd3b73505a137a52c3730ba7b22d120/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772107216","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable w